    {
      "id": "sol.hmmt-feb-team-2-2008-p5.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "We are given \\(j(0)=5, j(1)=7\\) and \\(j(2)=2\\). So \\(f(3)=3+j(0)=8\\) and \\(f(1)=1+j(1)=8\\). Thus \\(f(3)=f(1)\\) and so \\(f\\) is not a permutation of \\(\\mathbb{Z}\\), and hence 572 is not a juggling pattern. (In other words, there is a \"collision\" at times \\(t \\equiv 2(\\bmod 3)\\).)",
